			"notes": "Hill_Realm is a mod that brings the power of the mountains to Minecraft!\n\nThis mod adds:\n- Hill Crystal - A rare crystal found deep underground\n- Hill Ingot - Crafted from Hill Crystals, used to make powerful gear\n- Hill Tools - Pickaxe, Sword, Axe, Shovel, and Hoe, stronger than Netherite\n- Hill Armor - Full set of armor with high protection and toughness\n- Hill Apple - A magical fruit that grants powerful buffs\n- Hill Block & Hill Ore - Decorative blocks and ore that drops Hill Crystals\n- Hill (The Mountain Spirit) - A new mob to discover\n\nFeatures:\n- All tools and armor are repairable with Hill Ingots\n- Crafting recipes: 5 Iron Ingots -> 1 Hill Crystal, 9 Crystals -> 1 Hill Ingot, 9 Ingots -> 1 Hill Block\n- Ore generates between Y -60 and Y 0, similar to gold ore\n- Fully translated in English and Chinese\n\nPerfect for players who want to explore new heights and depths!\n\nRequires Fabric API and Minecraft 1.21.1.\n\nCreated by [PandaSX]"
		}
